  "description": "EXIKAZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C156 H106 F6 N12 O16 Y4. From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 6 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 7 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 6 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.537-3.844 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.85-112.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Y4(dbm)4L6(μ3-OH)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
